# I Can Hear a Rainbow (windurst 75): reply kinds at the House of the Hero (_6n2, Windurst Walls), against The Puppet
# Master's 403 (Event; accepted by GM: an earlier container on the door). The door's script answers nothing here. Level
# 30 with the ruby: 384 (Progress) beats 403, begun; made available again by GM: 384 again. Accepted at Prog 0: 385
# (Event, oncePerZone) and 403 cycle (403 first: The Puppet Master's container is the earlier); then 385 is spent: 403 alone.
lists WindurstWalls/_6n2/onTrigger WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/384
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=-24.5,-14.498,262.994 lvl=30
quest Windurst.ThePuppetMaster accepted
item CarbunclesRuby
login
trigger _6n2                                   # 384 (Progress) over The Puppet Master's 403 (Event)
finish                                         # begun
quest Windurst.ICanHearARainbow available      # GM
trigger _6n2                                   # 384 again
finish                                         # begun
trigger _6n2                                   # accepted, Prog 0: 403 (both Event: the earlier container's first)
finish
trigger _6n2                                   # 385 (the cycle)
finish
trigger _6n2                                   # 385 spent (oncePerZone): 403
finish
